    <div class="story__content">
      <h2 class="story__title">Structural Work</h2>
      <p class="story__text">
        Beyond propulsion hardware, I also worked on structural pieces and supporting fixtures where
        repeatability and a clear manufacturing sequence mattered more than complexity for its own sake.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text">
        Later, I have become advisor for members of the team planning on manufacturing components, helping them understand the tradeoffs and practicalities of different approaches.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

